  "title": "Slide Announces New Stock Repurchase Program of $100 Million",
  "summary": "TAMPA, Fla., April 28, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Slide Insurance Holdings, Inc. (“Slide” or the “Company”) (Nasdaq: SLDE) today announced that its Board of Directors has authorized a new common stock repurchase program of $100 million. The authorization is effective immediately, has no time limit,",
